    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Argus Class Steamknight</h2><p>Slow, steady, sustained heavy fire.</p>\n<p><strong>Brace:</strong> Bonus Action. While Braced, Heavy Cannon gains +2 to attack and Sustained Fire fires four shots instead of three. Moving ends Brace.</p>\n<p><strong>Advance:</strong> Bonus Action, move up to 15 ft; movement is manual and ends Brace.</p>\n<p><strong>Suppressive Barrage:</strong> 15-ft radius within 120 ft, Dexterity save, 3d6 piercing on failure and half on success; save/template handling is manual.</p>",
      "chat": "<p></p>"
    },
